e protagonist of this story. He is appointed with the role of “savior” by Edea, tasked with the job of saving the world from certain destruction. He is deeply traumatized due to his school-life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c119565"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4c/4c593ec735fc6ed9f9f22824afd68436c8d0801a9d259ea7991749f77334e5b9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/387373933f5350f808abb367ef3f8215aba93649ba790c209a1901bed9984cdb.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c119566","characterName":"イデア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c119566"},"originalCharacterName":"イデア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious alien who foresaw a future in which Earth gets destroyed and came to help prevent it from happening. She has a stoic demeanor, rarely ever expressing her emotions but carries somewhat of a motherly atmosphere. She tasks Manako with the role of savior, forcing him to take various actions to help save the planet."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c119566"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/daae2345c4a9f8bb88b6748a0b9219a9ed1a63f597fcc52743736e9eb69d98fc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9fa83b2c868e2910d3de1749cf0aab9f3e612bd510161211c897e6932deec958.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedNam